    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40864" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισκήν-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
